( Features) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (    - Zigbee 1.2 compatible \(using PTVO firmware\)) Tj
T* (    - Based on CC2530F256 microcontroller) Tj
T* (    - Powered by a CR2032 coin cell) Tj
T* (    - Integrated reed switch for contact detection) Tj
T* (    - LED indicator for status or pairing feedback) Tj
T* (    - Reset button for firmware or network reset) Tj
T* (    - Compact design suitable for enclosure integration) Tj
